From 7540562c71b51d7915abf8f10703494b13e48b51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lolren <loren.bufanu@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 10:32:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] snapshot: Add sensor-region tap to focus

Add a viewfinder tap gesture and a small PipeWire helper that discovers libcamera autofocus controls dynamically. Map taps through letterboxing, stream orientation and the effective configured sensor crop, submit Auto mode, window metering, an AfWindows region and AfTriggerStart atomically, show transient feedback only after acceptance, then restore continuous autofocus.

Signed-off-by: Lolren <loren.bufanu@gmail.com>
